# Cold, damp night: temperature low and humidity high at once, then both recover
present: seri-tool 0\.\d+\.\d+ \(SIM x60\) booting
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: OK\s*$
present: PRINTER\| .* TEMP LOW 24\.0C
present: PRINTER\| .* RH HIGH 97%
present: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: Temp LOW 24\.0C \(safe 26-29C\) Chawki
present: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: Humidity HIGH 97% \(safe 75-95%\) Chawki
present: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: Temp normal again
present: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: Humidity normal again
count == 1: SMS to .*Temp LOW
count == 1: SMS to .*Humidity HIGH
